### CampusQuest Gamification & Leaderboard Tests

### 1. Get XP, Level, and Level Progression
GET http://localhost:5000/xp
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Get Streak
GET http://localhost:5000/streak
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Get Achievements (With unlocked status)
GET http://localhost:5000/achievements
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Get Overall Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:5000/leaderboard

### 5. Get Weekly Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:5000/leaderboard/weekly

### 6. Get Monthly Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:5000/leaderboard/monthly

### 7. Get Accuracy Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:5000/leaderboard/accuracy
